    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23联考）抛掷两颗质地均匀的骰子，记录向上的面出现的数字，那么这两个数字之和等于8的概率是？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "5/36"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1/6"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1/12"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "5/24"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          123
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          117
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-01-p123.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 母题精讲1 · 讲义第117页",
            "pdfPage": 123
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看等可能的结果是什么。两颗骰子各有6种点数，按第一颗、第二颗区分，一共有36种等可能结果，不能把不同的点数和当成等可能。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "和为8的有（2，6）、（3，5）、（4，4）、（5，3）、（6，2），刚好5种。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=\\frac{5}{6\\times6}=\\frac5{36}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以概率为5/36，我们选A。这里（2，6）和（6，2）是两种结果，不能漏掉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
