    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26国考）某单位从所有职工中随机选3人参加某个会议，张立和李磊2人中只有1人被选中的概率是2人均被选中概率的30倍。问该单位有职工多少人？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "15"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "17"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "29"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "33"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          123
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          117
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-02-p123.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 母题精讲2 · 讲义第117页",
            "pdfPage": 123
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s12-t01-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设单位有n人。两种概率的总方案数相同，比较概率30倍，直接比较符合条件的选人方案就行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "只有1人被选中：先从张、李中选1人，有2种；其余2人从另外n−2人中选。两人都被选中：只需再从另外n−2人中选1人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\frac{2\\binom{n-2}{2}}{\\binom{n-2}{1}}=n-3=30"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两个方案数相除得到n−3，因此n−3=30，n=33。我们选D。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
